[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 782.629, "timestamp": "00:13:02", "text": "私は殺そうとしている。  [叫び声]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 784.069, "timestamp": "00:13:04", "text": "彼らは検問所に突入した。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 787.43, "timestamp": "00:13:07", "text": "今こそ彼らを止める絶好の機会かもしれない。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 790.31, "timestamp": "00:13:10", "text": "究極のものはどこにある？ ああ、Qって何？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 790.629, "timestamp": "00:13:10", "text": "ああ、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 793.11, "timestamp": "00:13:13", "text": "私死んだ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 803.03, "timestamp": "00:13:23", "text": "。 死ぬ。 死ぬ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 804.949, "timestamp": "00:13:24", "text": "なぜ目標を先導しなければならないのか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 806.71, "timestamp": "00:13:26", "text": "この矢では無理だ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 808.71, "timestamp": "00:13:28", "text": "ニース。   私が"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 814.002, "timestamp": "00:13:34", "author": "@bakononcopiumm", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/hb5sPAHLUD7fBrZZsmfkzISQWwRqI8BY1n8lceyhZz0sNISomD05pCwUe-GL2amD5y-voH_uYw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "wtf was that"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 817.785, "timestamp": "00:13:37", "author": "@bakononcopiumm", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/hb5sPAHLUD7fBrZZsmfkzISQWwRqI8BY1n8lceyhZz0sNISomD05pCwUe-GL2amD5y-voH_uYw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "how did you do that"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 818.749, "timestamp": "00:13:38", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 818.87, "timestamp": "00:13:38", "text": "[笑い]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 823.75, "timestamp": "00:13:43", "text": "おい、少なくとも俺の震えは。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 827.35, "timestamp": "00:13:47", "text": "スター・ロードをやります。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 829.829, "timestamp": "00:13:49", "text": "私は宇宙で家族を見つけた。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 830.505, "timestamp": "00:13:50", "author": "@TannerHernandez-u9i", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/rS3mcXLfYbbeP0EJ-TMgHjDTIugqwSIruRtSjdtZ9RxHyooV3hG_Ig908WUq